WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
The young one has no artistic ability

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:04,060
It will always exist, Xiaoxuan

3
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:05,540
Make one for me too

4
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:07,260
Hand-collared doll

5
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:09,180
There's still me

6
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:10,980
You think I don’t exist

7
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:16,430
Make it for my sisters

8
00:00:16,430 --> 00:00:17,990
I'll give you strawberry gummies to change the tubes.

9
00:00:17,990 --> 00:00:23,940
Strawberry gummies?

10
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:26,940
There seem to be two more cans in the warehouse.

11
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:28,460
I also have to find a chance to send an order.

12
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:31,170
Dependence on others is always a target

13
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:32,850
Only you can become stronger

14
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:35,050
Only in this way can you stay alive and take care of yourself

15
00:00:35,050 --> 00:00:36,010
Special training in the future

16
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:38,930
I will never show mercy. Ji Chuan protects us, but I am also the main force.

17
00:00:38,970 --> 00:00:40,730
Don't let this guy have a bad mouth just because he's hiding behind him

18
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:42,450
But my eyes are so poisonous tomorrow

19
00:00:42,450 --> 00:00:43,930
I will never lose to that steel whip again
